{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20183","headline":"江邑春霖奉赠陈侍御 · 孟郊","name":"江邑春霖奉赠陈侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上花木冻，雨中零落春。\n应由放忠直，在此成漂沦。\n嘉艳皆损污，好音难殷勤。\n天涯多远恨，雪涕盈芳辰。\n坐哭青草上，卧吟幽水滨。\n兴言念风俗，得意唯波鳞。\n枕席病流湿，檐楹若飞津。\n始知吴楚水，不及京洛尘。\n风浦荡归棹，泥陂陷征轮。\n两途日无遂，相赠唯沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}